458
00:18:36,500 --> 00:18:38,500
contracts like this

459
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:40,500
don't change hearts

460
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:42,500
and minds or build

461
00:18:42,500 --> 00:18:44,500
character. they actually undermine

462
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:46,500
this. now listen,

463
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:48,500
I know that the scouters who came up

464
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:50,500
with this idea are well

465
00:18:50,500 --> 00:18:52,500
intentioned and I'm sure they have

466
00:18:52,500 --> 00:18:54,500
good hearts, but they're setting

467
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:56,500
themselves up as

468
00:18:56,500 --> 00:18:58,500
enforcers and bosses

469
00:18:58,500 --> 00:19:00,500
rather than mentors and advisors.

470
00:19:00,500 --> 00:19:02,500
they don't understand this

471
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:04,500
yet and they will only see it after

472
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:06,500
it fails to work for them and this

473
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:08,500
sort of thing almost inevitably backfires.

474
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:10,500
now, how can I be

475
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:12,500
so sure about this? I've done it

476
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:14,500
myself. I found that it was

477
00:19:14,500 --> 00:19:16,500
a mistake. I stopped doing

478
00:19:16,500 --> 00:19:18,500
it, and me and my scouts were

479
00:19:18,500 --> 00:19:20,500
happier for it, I can tell you. so

480
00:19:20,500 --> 00:19:22,500
I would sit down with your son and I would ask

481
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:24,500
him what he wants to do

482
00:19:24,500 --> 00:19:26,500
and then help him make this happen.

483
00:19:26,500 --> 00:19:28,500
if what he wants to do is get out

484
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,500
and do more adventurous things,

485
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:32,500
then he can be the one who gets everybody

486
00:19:32,500 --> 00:19:34,500
moving. where does he want to go? what does he want

487
00:19:34,500 --> 00:19:36,500
to do? if none of the adults in his

