561
00:22:02,500 --> 00:22:04,500
happen because they emphasize patrols,

562
00:22:04,500 --> 00:22:06,500
youth leadership

563
00:22:06,500 --> 00:22:08,500
and then they make sure that each

564
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:10,500
individual scout gets the attention

565
00:22:10,500 --> 00:22:12,500
they deserve. the temptation, however,

566
00:22:12,500 --> 00:22:14,500
with a big troop is to manage

567
00:22:14,500 --> 00:22:16,500
scouts and herds rather than

568
00:22:16,500 --> 00:22:18,500
individuals or patrols.

569
00:22:18,500 --> 00:22:20,500
this herd approach is really very pragmatic

570
00:22:20,500 --> 00:22:22,500
