574
00:22:28,500 --> 00:22:30,500
very good and you get too far

575
00:22:30,500 --> 00:22:32,500
beyond that scale and things

576
00:22:32,500 --> 00:22:34,500
start to erode a little bit.

577
00:22:34,500 --> 00:22:36,500
if a troop runs on the herd plan,

578
00:22:36,500 --> 00:22:38,500
youth leaders are usually

579
00:22:38,500 --> 00:22:40,500
