580
00:22:40,500 --> 00:22:42,500
of the work. I will tell you that our

581
00:22:42,500 --> 00:22:44,500
troop has hovered at around 30

582
00:22:44,500 --> 00:22:46,500
for all the time I've been involved.

583
00:22:46,500 --> 00:22:48,500
I have to do some pretty high

584
00:22:48,500 --> 00:22:50,500
stepings as a scout master to keep up

585
00:22:50,500 --> 00:22:52,500
with conferences and to work

586
00:22:52,500 --> 00:22:54,500
with youth leaders. I know

587
00:22:54,500 --> 00:22:56,500
some scout masters are able to make

588
00:22:56,500 --> 00:22:58,500
this happen with a troop of 60 or 100,

589
00:22:58,500 --> 00:23:00,500
but I got to tell you it would be beyond

590
00:23:00,500 --> 00:23:02,500
me. even so, I think

591
00:23:02,500 --> 00:23:04,500
the size of a troop is immaterial so

592
00:23:04,500 --> 00:23:06,500
