637
00:24:34,500 --> 00:24:36,500
do you think that he

638
00:24:36,500 --> 00:24:38,500
is misbehaving intentionally?

639
00:24:38,500 --> 00:24:40,500
I mean, that's a question that they may not

640
00:24:40,500 --> 00:24:42,500
have considered themselves, and that

641
00:24:42,500 --> 00:24:44,500
question and their answers

642
00:24:44,500 --> 00:24:46,500
can lead you into a conversation about

643
00:24:46,500 --> 00:24:48,500
differences. I would tell

644
00:24:48,500 --> 00:24:50,500
the patrol leaders counsel

645
00:24:50,500 --> 00:24:52,500
that we all feel individually

646
00:24:52,500 --> 00:24:54,500
that we are the outside, or

647
00:24:54,500 --> 00:24:56,500
sometimes we feel like people don't

648
00:24:56,500 --> 00:24:58,500
