676
00:25:52,500 --> 00:25:54,500
an instance in your youth where you failed

677
00:25:54,500 --> 00:25:56,500
to do this, because I know I can

678
00:25:56,500 --> 00:25:58,500
share the regrets you feel

679
00:25:58,500 --> 00:26:00,500
and tell your scouts how you would

680
00:26:00,500 --> 00:26:02,500
like to have the chance to go back

681
00:26:02,500 --> 00:26:04,500
in time and make that right,

682
00:26:04,500 --> 00:26:06,500
but you can't. now the message

683
00:26:06,500 --> 00:26:08,500
is clear. no, scout is a burden,

684
00:26:08,500 --> 00:26:10,500
he's your brother scout,

685
00:26:10,500 --> 00:26:12,500
and we never let our brother scout down.

686
00:26:12,500 --> 00:26:14,500
it can take some extra effort and patience

687
00:26:14,500 --> 00:26:16,500
on our part, but that's why we're scouts.

688
00:26:16,500 --> 00:26:18,500
in the end you'll find that all

689
00:26:18,500 --> 00:26:20,500
the effort was worth it, because

690
00:26:20,500 --> 00:26:22,500
not only have you helped someone,

691
00:26:22,500 --> 00:26:24,500
