694
00:26:28,500 --> 00:26:30,500
could you offer your thoughts

695
00:26:30,500 --> 00:26:32,500
on dealing with brothers in a troop setting?

696
00:26:32,500 --> 00:26:34,500
my senior patrol leader has a younger brother.

697
00:26:34,500 --> 00:26:36,500
I've often told him he needs to treat

698
00:26:36,500 --> 00:26:38,500
his younger brother as he would any other scout,

699
00:26:38,500 --> 00:26:40,500
but despite my request,

