00:26:40,500 --> 00:26:42,500
he still treats him differently.

701
00:26:42,500 --> 00:26:44,500
sometimes he's belittling or difficult

702
00:26:44,500 --> 00:26:46,500
with his younger brother.

703
00:26:46,500 --> 00:26:48,500
well, when it comes to any family relationship-

704
00:26:48,500 --> 00:26:50,500
and that's brother to brother

705
00:26:50,500 --> 00:26:52,500
to children or husband and wife-

706
00:26:52,500 --> 00:26:54,500
there needs to be some straight talk

707
00:26:54,500 --> 00:26:56,500
that draws a line between family roles

708
00:26:56,500 --> 00:26:58,500
and scouting roles.

709
00:26:58,500 --> 00:27:00,500
now, I'm not suggesting that family roles

710
00:27:00,500 --> 00:27:02,500
