713
00:27:06,500 --> 00:27:08,500
when mom is in her scout master role,

714
00:27:08,500 --> 00:27:10,500
she's not mom anymore

715
00:27:10,500 --> 00:27:12,500
and her son is not a son.

716
00:27:12,500 --> 00:27:14,500
her son is a scout.

717
00:27:14,500 --> 00:27:16,500
when the older brother is a senior patrol leader,

718
00:27:16,500 --> 00:27:18,500
he's not an older brother anymore.

719
00:27:18,500 --> 00:27:20,500
the older patrol leader and his younger brother

720
00:27:20,500 --> 00:27:22,500
is a scout.

721
00:27:22,500 --> 00:27:24,500
there's a dividing line.

722
00:27:24,500 --> 00:27:26,500
outside of scouts, we have one role.

723
00:27:26,500 --> 00:27:28,500
in scouts, we have another role.

724
00:27:28,500 --> 00:27:30,500
what I'm saying is

725
00:27:30,500 --> 00:27:32,500
that any family relationship

726
00:27:32,500 --> 00:27:34,500
