00:27:44,500 --> 00:27:46,500
sometimes a trusted mediator

733
00:27:46,500 --> 00:27:48,500
or maybe the parent of these brothers

734
00:27:48,500 --> 00:27:50,500
will be beneficial in helping

735
00:27:50,500 --> 00:27:52,500
people sort this out.

