776
00:29:12,500 --> 00:29:14,500
and let's begin by saying: scout camping trips

777
00:29:14,500 --> 00:29:16,500
are for scouts

778
00:29:16,500 --> 00:29:18,500
and they go camping together in patrols.

779
00:29:18,500 --> 00:29:20,500
scout camping trips are not for adults

